1":62,"_63":64,"_65":66},"type","links","field","identitySource","label","身份来源","items",[67],{"_63":68,"_25":69},"The Level Design Book · unofficial adaptation","https://book.leveldesignbook.com/appendix/about","text","identity","项目身份与署名","value","Original writing: Robert Yang and contributors including Andrew Yoder. GameMap distributes an unofficial operational adaptation with its original CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license, attribution, source map, and third-party exceptions. The book authors and pi maintainers have not endorsed this package. No generated logo or maintainer portrait is used.","language","en","获取方式","full source","access","section","源码",[83],{"_63":84,"_25":85,"_86":87},"Complete skill package and license","https://github.com/OpenEnvision/GameMap/tree/main/docs/skills/level-design","note","Text-only package with SKILL.md, LICENSE.md, references, and templates. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 applies to this adaptation directory, not the whole repository; commercial distribution requires appropriate permission.","暂不可访问","演示","Instructions and templates, not a runnable demo — No engine plugin, executable level, benchmark result, or validated playtest is supplied.","教程",[93],{"_63":94,"_25":95,"_86":96},"Read the original book","https://book.leveldesignbook.com/","The underlying book remains authoritative. The skill reorganizes guidance and templates rather than claiming universal design laws or independently measured outcomes.","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","年份","2026","year","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[110,111],"dimensions","3D","2D","开发阶段",[115,116,117,118],"stages","需求规划","引擎与场景","测试验证","构建与发布","主题",[122,123,124,125,126,127,128,129],"tags","level-design","skill","blockout","playtesting","agent-neutral","CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0","noncommercial","unofficial-adaptation","延伸阅读",[132,133,134,135],{"_63":141,"_25":95},{"_63":140,"_25":69},{"_63":138,"_25":139},{"_63":136,"_25":137},"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 legal code","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode","Book licensing and third-party exceptions","https://book.leveldesignbook.com/appendix/license","Original authors and contributors","The Level Design Book","项目源码",[144],{"_63":142,"_25":85},"用途与特点","英文包包含任务分流、十三份主题与来源参考，以及三份可复用模板，主要面向 3D 关卡；用于 2D 时需明确调整的假设。包内记录 2026-10-16 快照，自述覆盖 94 项来源索引并包含未完成部分，不能当作独立运行或设计质量验证。原始写作署名 Robert Yang 与包括 Andrew Yoder 在内的贡献者，属于社区改编，而非官方书籍版本或 pi 维护者发布。采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，需保留署名和改动声明、遵守非商业及相同方式共享条件，并检查第三方例外；这些条款不会自动授权每个游戏输出。","detail","guidance","资源类型","技能包","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production",[179,180,181,182],[122,123,124,125,126,127,128,129],[175,176,177,178],[173,174],2026,{"_164":165,"_166":167,"_32":168},"tutorial",{"_63":94,"_25":95,"_17":164,"_86":96},"demo",{"_63":170,"_17":171,"_86":172},{"_63":84,"_25":85,"_17":169,"_86":87},"full-source","Instructions and templates, not a runnable demo","unavailable","No engine plugin, executable level, benchmark result, or validated playtest is supplied.","3d","2d","plan","scene","test","ship",{"_63":141,"_25":95},{"_63":140,"_25":69},{"_63":138,"_25":139},{"_63":136,"_25":137},{"_184":185},"documents",{"_76":186,"_35":187},[189,193,194,195,192,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,191,228,190,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246],[188,189,190,191,192],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedba